---
title: Frankfurt School → Token Architecture
type: connection
created: 2026-04-13
updated: 2026-04-13
sources:
  - FOUNDATIONS/philosophy/critical-theory.md
  - FOUNDATIONS/architecture/token-hierarchy.md
tags:
