# Integration Guide: Multi-Modal Token System

## 🎯 Overview

The dataimago design system now features a revolutionary multi-modal token structure that works both as a standalone repository and as a git submodule. This guide explains how to integrate and use the system.

## 🏗️ Repository Structure

### Standalone Usage
```
/Users/conet/GitHub/dataimago/dataimago/dataimago-design/
├── packages/
│   ├── tokens/         # Multi-modal token sources
│   │   └── src/
│   │       ├── sensory/      # Visual, auditory, haptic
│   │       ├── temporal/     # Animation, timing
│   │       ├── narrative/    # Discourse, tone
│   │       ├── cognitive/    # Reading levels, chunking
│   │       ├── uncertainty/  # AI confidence
│   │       └── ethical/      # Constraints
│   └── css/
│       └── dist/       # Generated CSS
│           ├── dataimago-multimodal.css  # Full token system
│           ├── quarto-light.scss         # Quarto light theme
│           └── quarto-dark.scss          # Quarto dark theme
```

### As Git Submodule
```
/your-project/ui/src/dataimago-design/
└── [same structure as above]
```

## 🔨 Build Process

### Building Tokens

```bash
cd packages/tokens

# Build everything
pnpm run build

# Or build separately:
pnpm run build:multimodal  # Build multi-modal CSS
pnpm run build:quarto      # Build Quarto themes
pnpm run build:legacy      # Build legacy compatibility
pnpm run build:icons       # Build icon system CSS
```

### Output Files

| File | Purpose | Use Case |
|------|---------|----------|
| `dataimago-multimodal.css` | Complete multi-modal token system | Next.js, modern apps |
| `quarto-light.scss` | Quarto light theme | Quarto websites |
| `quarto-dark.scss` | Quarto dark theme | Quarto websites |
| `dataimago.css` | Legacy compatibility | Existing implementations |

## 🔗 Git Submodule Setup

### Adding to Your Project

```bash
# In your R package or project root
git submodule add https://github.com/dataimago/dataimago-design.git ui/src/dataimago-design
git submodule update --init --recursive
```

### Updating the Submodule

```bash
# Pull latest changes
git submodule update --remote ui/src/dataimago-design
git add ui/src/dataimago-design
git commit -m "Update design system submodule"
```

## 📚 Quarto Integration

### In _quarto.yml

```yaml
format:
  html:
    theme: 
      light: ui/src/dataimago-design/packages/css/dist/quarto-light.scss
      dark: ui/src/dataimago-design/packages/css/dist/quarto-dark.scss
    css:
      - ui/src/dataimago-design/packages/css/dist/dataimago-multimodal.css
```

### In Custom SCSS

```scss
// Import the multi-modal token system
@import "ui/src/dataimago-design/packages/css/dist/dataimago-multimodal.css";

// Use tokens in your styles
.my-component {
  padding: var(--spacing-scale-md);
  border-radius: var(--spacing-radius-md);
  transition: all var(--temporal-animation-duration-normal);
}
```

## 🎨 Using Multi-Modal Tokens

### Visual Tokens (Traditional)
```css
/* Spacing */
--spacing-scale-xs: 0.25rem;
--spacing-scale-sm: 0.5rem;
--spacing-scale-md: 1rem;

/* Radii */
--spacing-radius-sm: 0.25rem;
--spacing-radius-md: 0.5rem;

/* Elevation */
--spacing-elevation-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
```

### Temporal Tokens (New!)
```css
/* Animation durations */
--temporal-animation-duration-instant: 50ms;
--temporal-animation-duration-fast: 150ms;
--temporal-animation-duration-normal: 250ms;

/* Loading states */
--temporal-latency-loading-showProgressAfter: 200ms;
--temporal-latency-loading-maxShimmerDuration: 1200ms;

/* Undo windows */
--temporal-latency-undo-window-minimum: 5000ms;
--temporal-latency-undo-window-standard: 10000ms;
```

### Ethical Constraints (Enforced!)
```css
/* Accessibility */
--ethical-accessibility-contrast-minimum-text: 4.5;
--ethical-accessibility-touch-target-minimum: 44px;

/* Motion dignity */
--ethical-dignity-motion-duration-maximum: 300ms;

/* Equity */
--ethical-equity-device-support-minimum-viewport: 320px;
```

## 🚀 Next.js Integration

```jsx
// Import tokens in your app
import '@dataimago/design/css/dist/dataimago-multimodal.css';

// Use in components
const Button = ({ intent = 'affirm' }) => (
  <button 
    className="btn"
    data-intent={intent}
    style={{
      padding: 'var(--spacing-scale-md)',
      transition: 'all var(--temporal-animation-duration-normal)'
    }}
  >
    Click me
  </button>
);
```

## ✅ Testing Your Integration

### 1. Verify Token Loading
```javascript
// In browser console
getComputedStyle(document.documentElement)
  .getPropertyValue('--spacing-scale-md'); // Should return '1rem'
```

### 2. Test Theme Switching
```javascript
// Light theme
document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', 'light');

// Dark theme  
document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', 'dark');
```

### 3. Verify Ethical Constraints
```css
/* This should automatically be limited to 300ms */
.animated {
  transition: all 500ms; /* Will be overridden to 300ms max */
}
```

## 🔧 Development Workflow

### Making Token Changes

1. **Edit tokens** in `packages/tokens/src/`
2. **Rebuild** with `pnpm run build`
3. **Test** in your application
4. **Commit** changes to the design repo
5. **Update** submodule in consuming projects

### CI/CD Integration

```yaml
# GitHub Actions example
- name: Update submodules
  run: git submodule update --init --recursive
  
- name: Build design system
  run: |
    cd ui/src/dataimago-design/packages/tokens
    pnpm install
    pnpm run build
```

## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Submodule Not Found
```bash
git submodule init
git submodule update
```

