## Migration Guide

### From Traditional Tokens

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Old Structure"
        O1[colors.json]
        O2[typography.json]
        O3[spacing.json]
    end
    
    subgraph "New Structure"
        N1[sensory/visual/colors.json]
        N2[sensory/visual/typography.json]
        N3[sensory/visual/spacing.json]
        N4[temporal/animation/durations.json]
        N5[ethical/accessibility.json]
        N6[narrative/discourse/acts.json]
    end
    
    O1 --> N1
    O2 --> N2
    O3 --> N3
    O1 -.-> N4
    O1 -.-> N5
    O1 -.-> N6
```

### Variable Name Mapping

| Old Variable | New Grammar | Compatibility |
|--------------|-------------|---------------|
| `--brand-primary` | `--sensory-visual-color-brand-primary` | Both available |
| `--spacing-md` | `--spacing-scale-md` | Both available |
| `--motion-fast` | `--temporal-animation-duration-fast` | Both available |
| `--text-primary` | `--sensory-visual-color-text-primary` | Both available |

