## File: ui/src/dataimago-design/README.md
````markdown
# dataimago Design System

**Token-first, ethics-enforced design foundation for all dataimago properties.**

> **Modern Sass Architecture**: This design system uses the Sass 3.0 module system (`@use`/`@forward`) for future-proof, maintainable stylesheets.

Treating design tokens like production code with measurable accessibility, dignity, transparency, and equity as first-class "ethical tokens" with CI gates.

## 🎯 Key Features

- **Conflict-Free Bootstrap Integration**: Eliminates CSS variable naming conflicts
- **90% Size Reduction**: Compared to legacy theme files (7KB vs 72KB)
- **Ethical Enforcement**: Built-in accessibility, dignity, and equity constraints
- **Single Source of Truth**: One token definition, multiple output formats
- **Drop-in Compatibility**: Works with existing Quarto/R package infrastructure

## 🏗️ Architecture

This is a monorepo containing the complete dataimago design system:

```
dataimago-design/
├── packages/
│   ├── tokens/                  # Source of truth for all design decisions
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── primitives/     # Base values (colors, spacing, typography)
│   │   │   ├── semantic/       # Role-based tokens (surface, content, brand)
│   │   │   ├── ethical/        # A11y, dignity, equity enforcement tokens
│   │   │   └── icons/          # Icon sizing, colors, states, transitions
│   │   ├── schemas/            # JSON Schema validation
│   │   ├── scripts/            # Build scripts for themes and compatibility
│   │   └── config/             # Style Dictionary configuration
│   ├── css/                    # Built CSS artifacts
│   │   ├── src/                # SCSS source files (bootstrap integration)
│   │   └── dist/               # Generated CSS files
│   │       ├── dataimago.css              # Core semantic variables (28KB)
│   │       ├── dataimago-icons.css        # Icon system with utilities (8KB)
│   │       ├── bootstrap-integration.css   # Conflict-free Bootstrap mapping (10KB)
│   │       ├── website-light.scss         # Quarto-compatible light theme (3KB)
│   │       └── website-dark.scss          # Quarto-compatible dark theme (5KB)
│   ├── icons/                  # SVG icon system
│   │   └── src/
│   │       ├── brand/          # Core dataimago logos (ai_monogram.svg)
│   │       ├── social/         # Social platform icons (github, bluesky)
│   │       └── platform/       # Technology platform icons (netlify, quarto)
│   └── components/             # Component examples (future)
├── tools/                      # Ethical enforcement scripts
│   ├── contrast-check.mjs     # WCAG contrast validation
│   ├── motion-lint.mjs        # Motion dignity enforcement
│   └── prepare-release.mjs    # Distribution preparation
├── examples/                   # Integration examples
│   └── bootstrap-integration-test.html
└── dist/                       # Symlink to packages/css/dist for backwards compatibility
```

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Build all tokens → CSS (including icons)
pnpm run build

# Validate tokens against ethical constraints
pnpm run validate

# Run ethical enforcement checks
pnpm run lint

# Build icon system separately
pnpm run build:icons
```

## 📦 Distribution & Integration

### Distribution Channels

The design system automatically distributes to 4 key locations in the R package:

1. **CDN Assets** (`inst/quarto-assets/`)
   - For jsDelivr distribution
   - Includes minified production files

2. **Website Assets** (`ui/www/assets/css/`)
   - For local development server
   - Includes source maps for debugging

