## 🧪 Filter Development

### Lua Filter Pattern
```lua
function Meta(meta)
  -- Process metadata
  meta.enhanced_property = generate_enhanced_data(meta)
  return meta
end

function Pandoc(doc)
  -- Process document structure
  doc = doc:walk({
    Div = process_divs,
    Span = process_spans
  })
  return doc
end

-- Return filter functions
