    "title": "dataimago API Reference",
    "section": "Description",
    "text": "Description\n\nThis function embodies dataimago’s principle of embedding AI within culture for emancipatory purposes.\n\nSets up the Node.js workspace structure and configuration files needed for CSS compilation and design token processing. This function creates the complete ui/ directory structure with package.json, build scripts, and source files.",
